  "notes": [
    "Complete list: 20 actions (src/actions.ts) and 10 boolean feedbacks (src/feedbacks.ts), each registered in one call (setActionDefinitions, setFeedbackDefinitions). Variables and presets are not catalogued.",
    "Third-party module (repository themusicnerd/companion-module-rossvideo-crossover, not the bitfocus organization). The manifest names bitfocus/companion-module-rossvideo-crossover as repository and the legacy id jvc-km-h2500. The README states live testing on a JVC KM-H2500 / CrossOver 6 only; the catalog was not tested against a device.",
    "Protocol: GVG-100 editor protocol over TCP (config option \"GVG-100 console port\", default 2100); the module also polls the switcher state (default 1000 ms) and has an optional web manager and FTP Media-Store client that are configuration only (no actions).",
    "Model dependency: the config option \"model\" (km-h2500 default, km-h3000, solo, 6, 12, 16) selects the source map; the Source dropdowns of set_source, cut_to_source, program_source, preview_source and key_source are therefore not enumerated (choicesNote). Actions and feedbacks are rebuilt on every configUpdated (src/main.ts:114-120).",
    "Quirk kept as in the source: the compact (CrossOver 6) map is used for models km-h2500, 6 and when no model is set; km-h3000 and solo use the 12-input map (src/protocol.ts getSourceMap()), while media_source treats only km-h2500 and 6 as compact (src/actions.ts:230).",
    "The number fields declare no asInteger; the callbacks cast with Number(). transition_layers builds a bitmask: key1=1, key2=2, background=4, key3=8, key4=16 (matching the ids of the transition_layer feedback).",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ~2.1.3: option values may be expressions (no option sets disableAutoExpression)."
  ]
}
